          </div>

          <fieldset class="group-box">
            <legend>암호 해독 입력</legend>
            <div style="font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:8px;">편지의 P.S. 암호를 해독해 찾은 5글자를 입력하세요.</div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <input type="text" id="cipher-input" class="xp-input" style="flex:1; min-width:170px;"
                placeholder="5글자 입력..." onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') checkCipher()" />
